lease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nIn a college campus activity, the usually quiet and introverted Xiao Zhang suddenly shines on stage. He wears sunglasses, wears his hat backwards, imitates the singing and movements of a famous singer, says he is that singer, and gives a stunning performance. His classmates all laugh at his performance, and the recorded video quickly becomes popular on the internet.\n\n[Question]\nWhy does Xiao Zhang say this?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Xiao Zhang chooses to disguise as a famous singer for entertaining his classmates, bringing everyone a surprise, and also for challenging himself, trying different lifestyles.\nB. Xiao Zhang disguises himself because he is tired of his real identity and wants to hide his true face.\nC. Xiao Zhang chooses to do this because of the encouragement and support from his classmates, he wants to show his versatility.\nD. Xiao Zhang does this because he really wants to become that famous singer, this is his career dream.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.0013249938623692377,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af58adc9aa9dc5a833d5315","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794476764515,"createTime":"2026-11-12 17:46:04","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"4d7f516b7c5d49e497d7b8c1ced40b9b"}